OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 12 MAR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,11,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,12,     Grecordings including a
OL,13,     Gperformance of Haydn's Trumpet
OL,14,     GConcerto from the Royal Scottish
OL,15,     GNational Orchestra.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: New Zealand
OL,17,     FComposers
OL,18,     GDonald Macleod explores five
OL,19,     Gclassical composers from the land
OL,20,     Gof the long white cloud, New
OL,21,     GZealand, focusing today on the
OL,22,     Glife and music of John Psathas.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
